            "notes": "If you are going against a Tracer or dive heroes, take [My Business, My Rules](item_0dac0a70-77f1-4560-8a4d-16304c022552) for the extra cooldown. \n\n[Calamity](item_d6cdfbfe-61f4-4aa2-979f-f7793000b15c) is a really good power, this is going to allow you to apply burn even more efficiently and consistently, you will also be able to set everyone on fire no matter the distance. Just use your coach gun and the next two shots from your weapon will apply burn, this is really good for getting Pharahs, Freja\u2019s Mercy\u2019s etc on fire or anyone at a far range.\n\nWe also pick up [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) for the extra cooldown on your coach gun and of course the extra AP",
